Eager to have a direct impact on the bank’s iOS app , one of the most visible and used touch points by millions of customers every month?

Join us at DKB Code Factory as a Mid-Level iOS Developer where your work will shape how users interact with their finances , ensuring secure, smooth, and delightful mobile experiences. 

} } ; 

{ your_responsibilities: [ 

- Design, implement and maintain high-quality iOS features with a focus on usability, performance, and security. 

- Own end - to - end delivery of feature s : from translat ing designs into reusable components to testing , releases support and post release monitoring. 

- Collaborate closely with Product, Design, Backend, Web and Android team counterpart s to ensure platform consistency and technically feasible solutions. 

- Apply Swift best practices and modern iOS patterns (Swift Concurrency, MVVMC, Combine) to scale the codebase and reduce technical debt. 

- Contribute to our internal design system by building accessible UI components compliant with Human Interface Guidelines and WCAG. 

- Improve engineering productivity and quality through enhancements to CI/CD, testing, and developer workflows 

] } ; 

{ following_qualifications_would_be_in_line_with_our_desired_profile_for_this_position: [ 

- Strong experience with Swift, Xcode, and shipping production iOS apps using SwiftUI and/or UIKit. 

- Practical knowledge of concurrency patterns (Swift Concurrency / Combine) and architecture patterns such as MVVMC. 

- Experience writing unit and UI tests with XCTest / Swift testing frameworks and delivering reliable test suites for CI. 

- Track record of translating design system specifications into reusable UI components and ensuring accessibility. 

- Familiarity with JSON APIs and integrating with backend contracts. 

- Comfortable working in English within a hybrid Berlin setup and collaborating across distributed, crossfunctional teams. 

- Nice to have: exposure to GitLab CI, experience in regulated/financial contexts (privacy/compliance considerations such as GDPR/PSD2), and crossplatform alignment experience. 

] } ; 

Got the feeling you don't match every single requirement? Don’t worry! We encourage you to apply anyways, even if your qualifications do not align perfectly. You might still be just the right candidate for us! 

